"    sudo grub-mkconfig -o /boot/grub/grub.cfg\n"
"systemd-boot: add it to the “options” line of your entry in /boot/loader/"
"entries/.\n"
"\n"
"Arch loads the graphics driver early (the kms hook), so also put the file in "
"the initramfs: add\n"
"    FILES=({file})\n"
"to /etc/mkinitcpio.conf, then run\n"
"    sudo mkinitcpio -P\n"
"\n"
"Reboot afterwards. If you had already set this up, the initramfs still holds "
"the old file: run “sudo mkinitcpio -P” and reboot.\n"
"\n"
"To undo, remove the parameter and the FILES entry, rebuild, and reboot."
